text Ooi, Miyazawaa.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text And I came here empty-handed, hoping she would make me lunch...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text It seems she's not just hiding somewhere; she really isn't here.
text @[Tomoya]
text I guess it can't be helped...
text I turn around, considering going to the cafeteria, but suddenly that seems like too much of a bother.
text @[Tomoya]
text Guess I'll make something myself...
text It shouldn't be too hard since all the cookware and spices are here.
text I walk over to stand where Miyazawa usually makes her dishes.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text There's a white container close to my feet.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I see... She's got a cooler box here...)
