text That's a basic rule to live by in this world, and I'm sure everyone is sick of hearing about it already. But coming from Miyazawa, even the same words sound unbelievably convincing.
text No... Perhaps this may be what she's been doing up until now: reminding everyone of things like this that are simple but easy to forget.
text Things anyone can say, but rarely ever bother to put into action.
text It isn't meant to change anyone; it's to help them return to how they used to be...
text With all the sincerity in the world, she looks straight into our eyes; her words make us remember things that are too obvious to ever truly sink into our mind.
text It's such a simple thing to do, and yet it's so impossible.
